    "sha256": "0eafa4e618aa234903b76ea3a529f1ed07ef4874e1f7502b34188c80cea166f9",
    "line_count": 94,
    "format": "uv pip freeze output: one name==version per line, LF line endings, final newline; no --hash options, comments, environment markers or index options (so every requirements[].hashes is empty)",
    "same_bytes": "The historical reproduction/run-20260926T0412Z/installed-freeze.txt was the reproduction's own `uv pip freeze` of the installed set (steps.log: 'installed set equals requirements-lock.txt'). It was byte-identical: 1834 bytes with the same sha256. Both files are removed; this record retains their content and provenance."
